  ('87bd1682-6a77-4152-aece-4fdf9736badc', 'GYM CLINIC', 3, '- Old outreach note: 8/12/25 "Hi there, I''m Tom from The Chiswick Calendar - we''re a local news and community platform covering Chiswick and the surrounding areas. I wanted to reach out because I think Gym Clinic would be a great fit for our Club Card scheme. We work with local health and wellness businesses to give them ongoing exposure to our readership through featured listings and newsletter mentions, with substantial reach and engagement in the local area. Would you be interested in a quick chat to hear more about how it works?"'),
