  ('fa394477-9cc3-4cc2-9521-9fa8d310af97', 'WALTON PERFORMING ARTS ACADEMY', 1, '- Old outreach note: 9/12/25 - Reached out about advertising via online form, replied with " Dear Adlyn,

Thank you for getting in touch – how exciting to hear about WPAA''s new Acting for Screen Course at Chiswick Cinema!
Since you''re launching in January 2026, a short, targeted campaign in the weeks before would make sense. Here are the options:

Website Advertising (1 month)

Leaderboard (top of page): £200
Side Panel (right-hand side): £250

The Side Panel generates nearly double the impressions (114,000+ vs 65,000+ monthly), so tends to deliver stronger results. Both include click and impression tracking.

Featured Article / Advertorial: £250

This is a dedicated article about your course, featured in our weekly newsletter which reaches 17,500+ subscribers with a ~50% open rate. Great for telling the full story of what you''re offering and driving sign-ups.
For a January launch, a combination of a month''s Side Panel advertising plus the advertorial would give you strong visibility across both the website and newsletter – total £500.

Let me know if any of that sounds of interest, or what specific time scale you''re looking at."'),
